-- My own stand-in for the general penalty of s 787(1) (a fine of not more than $5,000, or imprisonment for not more than two years less a day, or both: line 16717 of the text), passed where a section's punishment function asks for it.
`independent general penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, (`imprisonment for a term of` OF (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, TRUE)), `no imprisonment is stated`, (`a fine of` OF 5000), `no fine is stated`

